'''Stormwrought Castle''' is the first section of the [[Stormwrought Ruins]] dungeon, accessed from the dungeon's main entrance. It encompasses the castle's [[Stormwrought Barracks|barracks]], the [[Stormwrought Kitchen|kitchen]], a [[Stormwrought Library|library]], a [[Stormwrought Museum|museum]], [[Stormwrought Court|Duke Balor's court]], and the [[Stormwrought Prison|dungeons]]. From the prison, the caverns and lower levels of the [[Stormwrought Descent]] can be accessed with the [[Key to Stormwrought Castle]].

